ent) use PPO as their optimization backbone. Understanding PPO's clipped objective, advantage estimation, and multi-epoch updates is essential for correctly implementing RICE's training loops. The openai/baselines implementation provides the reference PPO code that RICE's authors likely built upon.\",\n            \"github_info\": {\n                \"repository_url\": \"https://github.com/openai/baselines\",\n                \"stars_count\": \"16,761\",\n                \"last_updated\": \"2024-08-01 (pushed); actively...[truncated 16516 chars]"}
